Usage: qodercli plugins install|i [options] <plugin>

Install a plugin from available marketplaces, a remote HTTPS .zip URL, or a
local directory path.

Arguments:
  plugin               Plugin name, plugin@marketplace, remote HTTPS .zip URL,
                       or local plugin directory path.

Options:
  -s, --scope <scope>  Installation scope: "user" (global, default), "project"
                       (shared, committed to VCS), or "local" (personal, not
                       committed). (choices: "user", "project", "local",
                       default: "user")
  --json               Output as JSON. (default: false)
  -h, --help           display help for command
